From bd58375878cd1740612ef8df6bf1c7cc95cd0c58 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fortune Code <fortunecodec@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 16:02:01 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add flow_upload_images and flow_agent_generate;
 agent-mode detection for the 2026-11 Flow UI

- flow_upload_images: real file chooser via the ingredient picker, returns media ids by caption
- flow_agent_generate: one call for Nano Banana images or Omni (frames-to-)video through the agent panel,
  auto-approve within max_credits, waits and downloads
- isManualMode: the composer Settings trigger is hidden in agent mode; treat that as agent mode
- agentChat: fall back to reading the quote from the page when the StreamChat body is unreadable

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
